    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n95489" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σμῆνος</span></b> , 
			Dor.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σμᾶνος</span></b> 
		<i><span class="en">
			Theoc.
			1.107
		</span></i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εος</span>, τό,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>beehive</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σμήνεσσι κατηρεφέεσσι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hes.
					<u>Th.</u>
					594
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				12.326.15
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>R.</u>
				552c
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				624a6
			</span></i> sq. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>swarm of bees</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ς. ὣς μελισσᾶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Pers.</u>
					128
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.), cf. <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Plt.</u>
				293d
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				627b15
			</span></i>, al.; of wasps, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>V.</u>
				425
			</span></i>; of <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνθρῆναι</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				629a7
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> generally,
				<i>swarm, crowd</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βομβεῖ δὲ νεκρῶν
				ς</span>. <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				879
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἷον σοφιστῶν ς</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Cratin.
				2
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ς. θεῶν</span>, of the clouds,
				<i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Nu.</u>
				297
			</span></i>: metaph., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ τῶν ἡδονῶν ς., ς. τι
				ἀρετῶν</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>R.</u>
				574d
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Men.</u>
				72a
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀποικιῶν σμήνη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Aristid.
					1.115
				</span></i>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				J.
			</span></i>: heterocl. pl., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σμῆνα
			μελισσάων</span> Orac. ap. <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.96b
			</span></i>. [pl. written <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ζμήνη</span></b> , <i><span class="en">
				<u>PCair.Zen.</u>
				151.4
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii B.C.)</span>.]</div>
